# Synced from Resnovas/.github templates/graphify-out/.gitignore. Edit it there.
#
# Commit what is shared or what cost money to produce; ignore the rest.
#
# Committed:
#   graph.json              the graph agents query; merged by Graphify's union
#                           merge driver (see .gitattributes)
#   cache/semantic*/        model output per document, keyed by content hash,
#                           so an unchanged document is never paid for twice
#
# Ignored:
#   GRAPH_REPORT.md,
#   .graphify_labels.json*  rebuilt from graph.json with no model on every
#                           update; committing them only causes merge conflicts
#   cache/ast/              local parser output: free to rebuild in seconds,
#                           and discarded on every Graphify upgrade anyway
#   cache/stat-index.json,
#   manifest.json           file timestamps from one machine
#   .graphify_root          an absolute path on one machine
#   graph.html              a large viewer page rebuilt on demand
#   cost.json, memory/      personal spend and query history

*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!graph.json
!cache/
cache/*
!cache/semantic/
!cache/semantic/**
!cache/semantic-deep/
!cache/semantic-deep/**
